  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="24c9a9e8-33c1-5d48-8519-e49ffd97ba0a" activityNameId="bce92da7-9e88-528b-9427-3e13b13da4d3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Production efforts, inductors</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Production efforts, inductors
Data are a rough estimation of the average production efforts over all types of inductors. Data for auxillaries, energy, emissions and waste are ouf of an international LCI database plus estimations based on the production efforts of capacitors. Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions. Updates were made in 2023, showing that 20% energy reduction is achieved; UUID: 82ee13e5-9223-3455-8542-7ddcca332822
This module includes auxillary and energy consumption, emissions (air, water) and waste amounts, as well as an estimation of the efforts for transportation and of the infrastructure for the production of inductors.
Location: Data from literature and estimation based on capacitor production efforts – here representing the global situation for inductor production.
Technology: average production comprising the following steps: core mounting; epxoy-curing; winding; welding; molding; marking; bending; testing and final control.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: own estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_82ee13e5-9223-3455-8542-7ddcca332822.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
